---
import SectionHeader from "./SectionHeader.astro";
---

<section id="components">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeader num="06" title="Components" sub="A small fixed set of atomic modules, kept only where they solve a concrete UI problem." />

    <div class="not-prose mb-8 rounded-xl border border-brand-ycp/30 bg-brand-ycp/5 p-6">
      <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-2">Powered by Nuxt UI</h4>
      <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">
        Mizu now extends Nuxt UI, providing a curated design token layer and theme on top of its robust component library. For common UI primitives — buttons, inputs, dialogs, cards, badges, and more — use Nuxt UI components directly (e.g. <code class="text-xs bg-surface-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">&lt;UButton&gt;</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-surface-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">&lt;UCard&gt;</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-surface-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">&lt;UDialog&gt;</code>) with Mizu's theme applied automatically. The components listed below are Mizu-specific additions that solve unique design problems not covered by Nuxt UI.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="comp-grid">
      <a href="/components/overlay/alert-dialog" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-foreground-primary transition-colors">AlertDialog</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Modal confirmation for destructive and critical actions.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/data/dashlist" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-foreground-primary transition-colors">DashList</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Definition list component for label-value pairs.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/data/data-table" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-foreground-primary transition-colors">DataTable</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Table component for displaying and interacting with structured data.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/data/metric" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-foreground-primary transition-colors">Metric</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Display component for showing statistics and KPIs.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/components/data/quote" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 card-hover border-surface-muted bg-surface-base no-underline group hover:border-brand-ycp/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--color-brand-ycp)]">
        <h4 class="text-[16px] font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-foreground-primary transition-colors">Quote</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground-secondary">Block quotation with default and accent variants.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
